        "document_title": "The NIST Cybersecurity Framework (CSF) 2.0",
        "source_id": "csf2",
        "check_status": "valid",
        "quote": "A contemporary example is\nartificial intelligence (AI), which has cybersecurity and privacy risks, as well as many\nother types of risk. The NIST Artificial Intelligence Risk Management Framework (AI\nRMF) w as developed to help address the se risks.",
